  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KtK framework 2004</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KtK ramavtal 2004</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KtK st&#xf6;djer en rad kvinnoorganisationer p&#xe5; Balkan genom ett ramavtal emd Sida. Huvudm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kvinnans roll i samh&#xe4;llet och att ge kvinnorna makten &#xf6;ver sina egna liv. En separat del av ramavtalet omfattar insatser med lokala organisationer mot trafficking.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kvinna till Kvinna supports a number of local women&apos;s organisations in the Balkans through a framework agreement with Sida. The overall goal is to strengthen the role of women in society and to empower local women. A separate part of the framework agreement covers anti-trafficking activities in co-operation with local organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
